{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the broader regression source: the new shrimp food-access hook was affecting condition more aggressively than intended for baseline tanks. I’m softening only the condition-side interpretation of consumed food so substrate still matters, but default tanks don’t lose reproductive performance disproportionately."}}
